"активном профиле ``test``; в примере ниже он включён явно через "
"``@ActiveProfiles(\"test\")``."
msgstr "This file can hold test profile settings. Resources in ``src/test/resources`` are available to tests and excluded from the main application artifact. ``application-test.yml`` loads when the ``test`` profile is active; the example below explicitly enables it with ``@ActiveProfiles(\"test\")``."

